From f057655c1d01e5d0a302c0f86d365937311f770d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@example.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 11:32:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Patch 14: recycle bin and favorites album

- Albums list gains Favorites (first) and Recycle bin (last), shown only when non-empty
- Recycle bin screen reuses the album timeline: select to Restore or Delete forever, Empty button,
  viewer variant with Restore / Delete forever
- Special albums reuse the bucket id slot (SpecialAlbums) so paging, timeline, selection and viewer all work unchanged
- Selection bar takes a list of actions; library and recycle-bin action sets
- Permanent delete via MediaStore.createDeleteRequest (batched, system confirmation)
